# (1 + 2^-12)^2 = 1 + 2^-11 + 2^-24 rounds (ties to even) to 1 + 2^-11, so the sum is +0;
# a fused multiply-add would give 2^-24 (0x33800000).
title: vmla.f32 rounds the product before the add (not fused)
ref: A8.8 VMLA, VMLS (floating-point): product = FPMul(); FPAdd(Vd, product) (two roundings)

[code]
00ee201a    vmla.f32 s2, s0, s1
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x3F800800
s1 = 0x3F800800
s2 = 0xBF801000

[out]
s2 = 0x00000000
